usage: run_regression.py [-h] [--root ROOT] --start START --end END
                         [--include INCLUDE] [--report REPORT]
                         [--timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS] [--dry-run]

Run a deterministic regression selection across stage directories. The
selector includes only test files under tests/stageN for the inclusive range,
plus optional explicit test paths. It emits a machine-readable evidence
report.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --root ROOT
  --start START
  --end END
  --include INCLUDE     additional explicit pytest path (repeatable)
  --report REPORT       write JSON evidence report
  --timeout-seconds TIMEOUT_SECONDS
                        hard timeout for pytest (default: 1800 seconds)
  --dry-run             print selection without executing pytest
